> Ask Pell what happened   [success, watch 33]
  "'It came down on me when I leaned on it,' says Pell through their teeth. 'I can't shift it from under. There's a pry bar in Dry stores, if you can fetch it. Or dig me out, if you've the time. Don't just haul on it; I heard something crack already.'"
> Lever the fallen timber rack up with a pry bar   [success, watch 34]
  "You get a pry bar under the fallen timber rack and lean on it. It lifts a hand's breadth, and Pell drags the leg clear: bruised and cut, but whole."
> Collect the bronze tram bearing for Bran   [success, watch 35]
  "Bran takes the bronze tram bearing."
  ~ Bran gains 1 the bronze tram bearing.
> Ask Pell what they mean to do   [success, watch 36]
  "'Home,' says Pell. 'If you're going that way, I'll come with you. If not, I'll manage. I'm not sitting down here another hour.'"
> Ask Pell to come with you   [success, watch 37]
  "Pell falls in beside you."
